{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14271","headline":"秋日洛阳官舍寄上水部家兄 · 窦牟","name":"秋日洛阳官舍寄上水部家兄","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"洛阳归老日，此县忽爲君。\n白发兄仍见，丹诚帝岂闻。\n九衢横逝水，二室散浮云。\n屈指豪家尽，伤心要地分。\n禁中周几鼎，源上汉诸坟。\n貔虎今无半，狐狸宿有羣。\n威声慙北部，仁化乐南薰。\n野檗饥来食，天香静处焚。\n壮年唯喜酒，幼学便诃文。\n及尔空衰暮，离忧讵可闻。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦牟","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14271.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14271","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}